{"id":"vasi","name":"Vasi","type":"character","aliases":[],"description":"A gifted young loyalist girl captured by the rebels, who trains with Felothar and learns to commune with the ancestors.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2026-07-06","last_seen":"2026-07-06","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Spirits of the Abzan","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Izzy Wasserstein"],"date":"2026-07-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Spirits of the Abzan\" by Izzy Wasserstein. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Jul 2026."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"spirits-of-the-abzan-e3","era":null,"summary":"Inside the tent, Felothar finds the girl Vasi and duels her, and Felothar ends up pinning her at sword point.","participants":["felothar","vasi"],"location":"the-mobile-garrison","importance":"major","page":"stories/spirits-of-the-abzan","order":861,"story_date":"2026-07-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"\"Fair enough,\" the girl pants. \"My name is Vasi.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan#:~:text=%22Fair%20enough%2C%22%20the%20girl,%22My%20name%20is%20Vasi.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Spirits of the Abzan","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Izzy Wasserstein"],"date":"2026-07-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan#:~:text=%22Fair%20enough%2C%22%20the%20girl,%22My%20name%20is%20Vasi.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Spirits of the Abzan\" by Izzy Wasserstein. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Jul 2026."}},{"id":"spirits-of-the-abzan-e4","era":null,"summary":"Felothar offers to train Vasi instead of kil