%20by%20Dromoka%27s,escape%20until%20we%27ve%20dueled.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Spirits of the Abzan\" by Izzy Wasserstein. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Jul 2026."}},{"id":"spirits-of-the-abzan-e6","era":null,"summary":"A month into Vasi's training, Felothar spars with her in the caverns, corners her and teaches a lesson about terrain.","participants":["felothar","vasi"],"location":"the-rebel-caverns","importance":"minor","page":"stories/spirits-of-the-abzan","order":861,"story_date":"2026-07-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":49,"quote":"She pivots and knocks the blade from Vasi's hand, then puts the flat of her blade to the girl's neck.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan#:~:text=She%20pivots%20and%20knocks,to%20the%20girl%27s%20neck.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Spirits of the Abzan","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Izzy Wasserstein"],"date":"2026-07-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan#:~:text=She%20pivots%20and%20knocks,to%20the%20girl%27s%20neck.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Spirits of the Abzan\" by Izzy Wasserstein. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Jul 2026."}},{"id":"spirits-of-the-abzan-e7","era":null,"summary":"Vasi mentions her ward-sister, then angrily changes the subject.","participants":["vasi","felothar"],"location":"the-rebel-caverns","importance":"minor","page":"stories/spirits-of-the-abzan","order":861,"story_date":"2026-07-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":53,"quote":"\"My ward-sister always said the terrain makes the battle.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/spirits-of-the-abzan#:~:text=%22My%20ward%2Dsister%20always%20said,terrain%20makes%20the%20battle.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the C